        <rdfs:label>BiophysicalMonitors</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Biophysical Monitors are the most elaborated monitors implemented in The Virtual Brain that instantiate a physically realistic measurement process on the simulation, such as (S)EEG, MEG, and fMRI BOLD signals.</skos:definition>
