    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/I_G2D -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/I_G2D">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Generic2dOscillator"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Input"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Vdot_G2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>I_G2D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Baseline shift of the cubic nullcline</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>I_G2D is a constant parameter in the first state-equation Vdot_G2D.

This constant shifts (up or down) the N-shaped cubic V_G2D-nullcline in the phase-plane with respect to the y-axis, moving with it the crossing point with the other W_G2D-nullcline, i.e., changing the stability of the fixed point. For &apos;I_G2D &lt; 0&apos;, the system has a stable fixed point and the it corresponds to a damped oscillatory state, whereas for &apos;I_G2D &gt; 0&apos;, the system enters in a stable limit cycle and switches to an oscillatory state.

 I_G2D is, thus, an excitable input parameter that can either represent an external input membrane current or neural membrane excitability.

Note:
------
I_G2D also serves as entry point for the global and local connections to embed the G2D in a BNM.</skos:definition>
        <category>Parameter</category>
        <defaultValue>0.0</defaultValue>
        <defaultValue rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</defaultValue>
        <identifier>000549</identifier>
        <range>lo=-5.0, hi=5.0, step=0.01</range>
        <subcategory>Input Current</subcategory>
        <symbol>I</symbol>
        <synonym>Iext</synonym>
    </owl:Class>
    


