Jansen BH and Rit VG. Electroencephalogram and visual evoked potential generation in a mathematical model of coupled cortical columns. Biol. Cybern. 73, 357:366, 1995.</references>
        <symbol>J</symbol>
        <synonym>C</synonym>
        <tvbSourceVariable>J</tvbSourceVariable>
    </owl:Class>
    


