        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Model</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Models define the set of default local neural dynamical models currently implemented in TVB as mesoscopic units for large-scale brain network models, including their extensions to a dense network of neural masses.

Note:
------
