            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>TimeDelays</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Time Delays are finite conduction times of signal transmission via long-range connections that depend on the length of the fiber tract connecting two points, dij, and the transmission speed, c.</skos:definition>
        <acronym>tau</acronym>
        <equation>Expression of Time Delays.

tau_ij = d_ij / c

where</equation>
