            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>Wdot_LB</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Derivative of the state-variable W_LB of the Larter-Breakspear with respect to time (Breakspear et al., 2003a, 2003b).</skos:definition>
