(Jansen &amp; Rit, 1995) Jansen BH and Rit VG. Electroencephalogram and visual evoked potential generation in a mathematical model of coupled cortical columns. Biol. Cybern. 73, 357:366, 1995.</references>
        <shortName>P-I coupling</shortName>
        <symbol>\alpha_3</symbol>
        <synonym>(C3_JR)/(J_JR)</synonym>
        <synonym>(c23_JR)/(J_JR)</synonym>
        <synonym>a3</synonym>
        <tvbSourceVariable>a_3</tvbSourceVariable>
    </owl:Class>
    


