    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/b_G2D -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/b_G2D">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/DynamicalParameter"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/FeedbackScaling"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Generic2dOscillator"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_coefficient_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/V_G2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Wdot_G2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0098873"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0099178"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>b_G2D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Linear slope of the configurable nullcline</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>b_G2D is the coefficient of the linear feedback coupling term of the state-variable V_G2D to the second state-equation Wdot_G2D.

This coefficient rotates the configurable linear (i.e., for c_G2D = 0) W_G2D-nullcline in the phase-plane or shifts the configurable quadratic W_G2D-nullcline, otherwise.</skos:definition>
        <category>Parameter</category>
        <defaultValue>-10.0</defaultValue>
        <defaultValue rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">-10</defaultValue>
        <identifier>001015</identifier>
        <range>lo=-20.0, hi=15.0, step=0.01</range>
        <symbol>b</symbol>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/b_JR -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/b_JR">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/JansenRit"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/TimeConstant"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_coefficient_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/sigm_y0_3_JR"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_coefficient_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/y2_JR"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_coefficient_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/y5_JR"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/y5dot_JR"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060080"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>b_JR</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Rate constant of the inhibitory post-synaptic potential (IPSP). It is interpreted as being the lumped representation of the sum of the reciprocal of the time constant of passive membrane and all other spatially distributed delays, including temporal dispersion in the afferent tract, synaptic diffusion, and resistive-capacitive delay in the dendritic network (Freeman 1975).</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>Reciprocal of the time constant of passive membrane and all other spatially distributed delays in the dendritic network [ms^-1]. Also called average synaptic time constant.</skos:definition>
        <category>Parameter</category>
        <defaultValue>0.05</defaultValue>
        <defaultValue rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.05</defaultValue>
        <dynamicsExploration>Exploration of the dynamics using p, y0 and b (1/taui) as control parameters.

https://www.frontiersin.org/files/Articles/463671/fncom-13-00054-HTML/image_m/fncom-13-00054-g006.jpg

Stefanovski L, Triebkorn P, Spiegler A, Diaz-Cortes MA, Solodkin A, Jirsa VK, McIntosh AR, Ritter P for the Alzheimer&apos;s Disease Neuroimaging Initiative. Linking Molecular Pathways and Large-Scale Computational Modeling to Assess Candidate Disease Mechanisms and Pharmacodynamics in Alzheimer&apos;s Disease. Front Comput Neurosci 2019, 13: 54. https://doi.org/10.3389/fncom.2019.00054</dynamicsExploration>
        <identifier>001016</identifier>
        <range>lo=0.025, hi=0.075, step=0.005</range>
        <references>Jansen BH, Zouridakis G, and Brandt M. A neurophysiologically-based mathematical model of flash visual evoked potentials. Biol. Cybern. 68, 275:283, 1993. https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00224863

(Jansen &amp; Rit, 1995) Jansen BH and Rit VG. Electroencephalogram and visual evoked potential generation in a mathematical model of coupled cortical columns. Biol. Cybern. 73, 357:366, 1995.

(van Rotterdam et al., 1982) van Rotterdam A, Lopes da Silva FH, van den Ende J, Viergever MA, Hermans AJ (1982) A model of the spatial-temporal characteristics of the alpha rhythm. Bull Math Biol 44:283-305.

(Freeman 1975) Mass action in the nervous system. Examination of the neurophysiological basis of adaptive behavior through the EEG. Academic Press, New York, 1975.</references>
        <symbol>b</symbol>
        <synonym>taui_JR^-1</synonym>
        <tvbSourceVariable>b</tvbSourceVariable>
        <unit>ms^-1</unit>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/b_LB -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/b_LB">
