        <skos:definition>g_G2D is the coefficient of the linear V_G2D term in the first state-equation Vdot_G2D.

This coefficient rotates the N-shaped cubic V_G2D-nullcline in the phase-plane.</skos:definition>
        <category>Parameter</category>
        <defaultValue>0.0</defaultValue>
        <defaultValue rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer">0</defaultValue>
