            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>gamma_GL</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Slope parameter of the state-variable &apos;x_GL&apos;, representing the inverse of the relaxation time.

Note: The ‘minus’ sign for the self-connections, scaled by &apos;gamma_GL&apos;, guarantees that the nodes have a stable equilibrium point (ref).</skos:definition>
        <category>Parameter</category>
        <defaultValue rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">-10.0</defaultValue>
        <identifier>001179</identifier>
        <range>lo=-100.0, hi=0.0, step=1.0</range>
        <subcategory>Time Constant</subcategory>
        <symbol>gamma</symbol>
    </owl:Class>
    


