        <skos:definition>Kinetic parameter</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>Kinetic parameter

Note:
-----
In the original publication, &apos;gamma_RWW&apos; is divided by 1000 for expressing the whole system in millisecond. In TVB, the variables set in second have been directly converted in millisecond.</skos:definition>
        <category>Parameter</category>
        <defaultValue>0.641</defaultValue>
