    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_E2D -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_E2D">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/ConditionalDerivedVariable"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_argument"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x1_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/modification_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/s_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x0_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x1_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/zcond_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_state_variable"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x1_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_function_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/zdot_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/zdot_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>h_E2D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The slow permittivity state-variable (z_E2D) in Epileptor2D can be modified to account for the time difference between the interictal (between seizures) and ictal (during seizure) states (Proix et al., 2014).

When modification is True, the function h_E2D uses a nonlinear influence on z_E2D. The default value is False, i.e., linear influence on z_E2D.</skos:definition>
        <category>Derived Variable</category>
        <category>Function</category>
        <equation>Equations of the h.

math::
if modification:
            h(x) = x_{0} + 3. / (1. + exp(- (x+ 0.5) / 0.1))
 else:
            h(x) = s * (x - x_{0})</equation>
        <identifier>001193</identifier>
        <references>(Proix et al., 2014) Proix, T.; Bartolomei, F; Chauvel, P; Bernard, C; Jirsa, V.K. Permittivity coupling across brain regions determines seizure recruitment in partial epilepsy. J Neurosci 2014, 34:15009-21.</references>
        <symbol>h</symbol>
        <value>np.where(modification&gt;0, x0 + 3.0 / (1.0 + numpy.exp(-(x1 + 0.5) / 0.1)), 4 * (x1 - x0) + zcond)</value>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_E5D -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_E5D">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/ConditionalDerivedVariable"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_argument"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x1_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/modification_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/s_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x0_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_parameter"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/zcond_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_state_variable"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x1_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_function_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/zdot_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/zdot_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>h_E5D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>The slow permittivity state-variable (z_E5D) in Epileptor5D can be modified to account for the time difference between the interictal (between seizures) and ictal (during seizure) states (see Proix et al., 2014, 2017).

When modification is True, the function h_E5D uses a nonlinear influence on z_E5D. The default value is False, i.e., linear influence on z_E5D.</skos:definition>
        <category>Derived Variable</category>
        <category>Function</category>
        <equation>Expression of h_E5D.

math::
if modification:
            h(x_{1}) = x_{0} + 3. / (1. + exp(- (x_{1} + 0.5) / 0.1))
 else:
            h(x_{1}) = s * (x_{1} - x_{0})</equation>
        <identifier>001194</identifier>
        <references>(Proix et al., 2014) Proix T, Bartolomei F, Chauvel P, Bernard C, Jirsa VK. Permittivity coupling across brain regions determines seizure recruitment in partial epilepsy. J Neurosci 2014, 34:15009-21.</references>
        <symbol>h</symbol>
        <value>numpy.where(modification&gt;0, x0 + 3 / (1 + numpy.exp(-(x1 + 0.5) / 0.1)), 4 * (x1 - x0) + zcond)</value>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_KIE -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_KIE">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Function"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/KIonEx"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/has_state_variable"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/n_KIE"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/I_Na_KIE"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>h_KIE</rdfs:label>
        <identifier>001195</identifier>
        <symbol>h</symbol>
        <value>1.1 - 1.0 / (1.0 + numpy.exp(-8.0 * (n - 0.4)))</value>
    </owl:Class>
    


