    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/x0_E2D -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x0_E2D">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor2D"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_coefficient_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_E2D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0043179"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>x0_E2D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Degree of excitability or epileptogenicity in Epileptor2D (Proix et al.,2014).

If x0 is greater than a critical value, x0,critic = −2.05 (i.e., in the supercritical regime), the system can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state (i.e., in the subcritical regime).

Note:
- If modification_E2D:
if x0 is smaller than a critical value, x0,critic = 2.91, can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state (Proix et al., 2014).</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>Epileptogenicity parameter.</skos:definition>
        <category>Parameter</category>
        <defaultValue>-1.6</defaultValue>
        <identifier>001508</identifier>
        <range>lo=-3.0, hi=-1.0, step=0.1</range>
        <references>(Proix et al., 2014) Proix, T.; Bartolomei, F; Chauvel, P; Bernard, C; Jirsa, V.K. Permittivity coupling across brain regions determines seizure recruitment in partial epilepsy. J Neurosci 2014, 34:15009-21.</references>
        <symbol>x0</symbol>
        <synonym>Epileptogenicity</synonym>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/tvbo/x0_E5D -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x0_E5D">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Epileptor5D"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Excitability"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Parameter"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/h_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_parameter_in"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/zdot_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/surrogate_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0060079"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>x0_E5D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Epileptogenicity Parameter. Degree of excitability or epileptogenicity in Epileptor5D (Jirsa et al.,2014).

If x0 is greater than a critical value, x0,critic = −2.05, the system can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state.

Note:
- If modification_E5D:
if x0 is smaller than a critical value, x0,critic = 2.91, can trigger seizures autonomously; otherwise it is in its equilibrium state (Proix et al., 2014).</skos:definition>
        <category>Constant</category>
        <defaultValue rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">-1.6</defaultValue>
        <identifier>001509</identifier>
        <range>lo=-3.0, hi=-1.0, step=0.1</range>
        <references>(Jirsa et al.,2014) Jirsa, VK, Stacey W C, Quilichini P P, Ivanov AI, Bernard C. On the nature of seizure dynamics. Brain, 2014, (137) 8, p: 2210–2230.

(Proix et al., 2014) Proix, T.; Bartolomei, F; Chauvel, P; Bernard, C; Jirsa, V.K. Permittivity coupling across brain regions determines seizure recruitment in partial epilepsy. J Neurosci 2014, 34:15009-21.</references>
        <shortName>Epileptogenicity</shortName>
        <symbol>x_0</symbol>
    </owl:Class>
    


