        <rdfs:label>x1_E5D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>First state-variable of the first Epileptor5D population (Jirsa et al.,2014).

The first population (x1_E5D, y1_E5D) corresponds to the mathematical form of the standard model in Hindmarsh and Rose (1984).

(x1_E5D, y1_E5D) are coupled oscillators accounting for the low-voltage fast discharges (very fast oscillations) at the fastest time scale.</skos:definition>
        <category>State Variable</category>
        <identifier>001512</identifier>
        <references>Jirsa, VK, Stacey W C, Quilichini P P, Ivanov AI, Bernard C. On the nature of seizure dynamics. Brain, 2014, (137) 8, p: 2210–2230.

Hindmarsh JL, Rose RM. A model of neuronal bursting using three coupled first order differential equations. Proc R Soc Lond B Biol Sci 1984; 221: 87–102.</references>
        <shortName>VeryFast SV</shortName>
        <stateVariableRange>-2.0, 1.0</stateVariableRange>
        <symbol>x_1</symbol>
    </owl:Class>
    


