        <rdfs:label>x1dot_E2D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:altLabel>xdot_E2D</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition>Derivative of the first state-variable x_E5D in Epileptor2D.</skos:definition>
        <category>Time Derivative</category>
        <category>TimeDerivative</category>
        <equation>Equations of xdot_E2D.


\dot{x} &amp;=&amp;tt ( c - f(x) - z + I_{ext})</equation>
        <identifier>001516</identifier>
        <references>(Proix et al., 2014) Proix, T.; Bartolomei, F; Chauvel, P; Bernard, C; Jirsa, V.K. Permittivity coupling across brain regions determines seizure recruitment in partial epilepsy. J Neurosci 2014, 34:15009-21.</references>
        <symbol>xdot</symbol>
        <value>tt * (c - z + Iext+local_coupling*x1 + Kvf * c_pop0 - x1cond * x1)</value>
    </owl:Class>
    


