        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_state_variable_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/f_1_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_state_variable_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/f_2_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_state_variable_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x1cond_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_state_variable_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/x2dot_E5D"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/is_state_variable_of"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/y2cond"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:label>x2_E5D</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>First state-variable of the second Epileptor5D sub-population (Jirsa et al.,2014).

The second sub-population (x2_E5D, y2_E5D) corresponds to the mathematical form of an excitable system with a saddle node on invariant circle bifurcation as shown by Roy et al. (2011). (x2_E5D, y2_E5D) are coupled oscillators accounting for the spike-and-wave discharges and interictal spikes on an intermediate time scale.</skos:definition>
        <category>State Variable</category>
        <identifier>001519</identifier>
        <references>(Jirsa et al., 2014) Jirsa, VK, Stacey W C, Quilichini P P, Ivanov AI, Bernard C. On the nature of seizure dynamics. Brain, 2014, (137) 8, p: 2210–2230.

(Roy et al., 2011) Roy D, Ghosh A, Jirsa VK. Phase description of spiking neuron networks with global electric and synaptic coupling. Phys Rev E Stat Nonlin Soft Matter Phys 2011; 83 (5 Pt 1): 051909.</references>
        <shortName>Fast SV</shortName>
        <stateVariableRange>-2.0, 0.0</stateVariableRange>
        <symbol>x_2</symbol>
    </owl:Class>
    


