        <category>Function</category>
        <equation>Expression of IE_RWW_EI.


I_{E,i} = W_{E}I_{0} + w_{+}J_{NMDA}S_{E,i} + J_{NMDA}[G\sum_{j}C_{ij}S_{E,i}] - J_{i}S_{I,i} + I_{ext}</equation>
        <identifier>001532</identifier>
        <references>(Deco et al., 2014) Deco G, Ponce-Alvarez A, Hagmann P, Romani GL, Mantini D, Corbetta M. How local excitation–inhibition ratio impacts the whole-brain dynamics. J Neurosci, 2014 34(23): 7886-7898.</references>
        <symbol>I_E</symbol>
        <synonym>x_E</synonym>
        <tvbSourceVariable>x_e</tvbSourceVariable>
        <unit>nA</unit>
        <value>a_e*(w_p*J_N_S_e-J_i*S_i+W_e*I_o+coupling+I_ext)-b_e</value>
    </owl:Class>
    


