        <rdfs:label>xdot_SUPH</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Derivative of the first state-variable, x_SUPH, of the Supercritical Hopf model with respect to time.</skos:definition>
        <category>Time Derivative</category>
        <category>TimeDerivative</category>
        <equation>The state equation of the first state-variable x reads as follows:

For all node i,

xdot_i = (a_i – x_i ** 2 – y_i ** 2) x_i – omega_i * y_i + lrc_x + src_x</equation>
