        <skos:definition>Second state-variable of the first Epileptor5D sub-population (Jirsa et al.,2014).

The first sub-population (x1_E5D, y1_E5D) corresponds to the mathematical form of the standard model in Hindmarsh and Rose (1984). (x1_E5D, y1_E5D) are coupled oscillators accounting for the low-voltage fast discharges (very fast oscillations) at the fastest time scale.</skos:definition>
